--- !u!114 &91920157
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 91920153}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: faebd17381c790a4da402b2f12f51708, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - Title: 'Experimental: Ranked Mode'
    Body: 'Greetings Trainer!

      As an experimental feature a ranked queue has
      been added to the game!'
    PreviewImage: {fileID: 0}
  - Title: 'Experimental: Ranked Mode'
    Body: Please note that this mode is very prone to breaking so please keep that
      in mind
    PreviewImage: {fileID: 0}
  - Title: 'Experimental: Ranked Mode'
    Body: 'Ranked is formed by 6 ranks: Beginner, Great, Expert, Veteran, Ultra and
      Master with each rank having 3 to 5 classes.'
    PreviewImage: {fileID: 0}
  - Title: 'Experimental: Ranked Mode'
    Body: 'To advance you gain diamonds by winning games, and upon winning with full
      diamonds you''ll increase in class.

      Winning while on the last class
      of a rank will result in a rankup'
    PreviewImage: {fileID: 0}
  - Title: 'Experimental: Ranked Mode'
    Body: In Master rank classes are gone and you just keep collecting diamonds.
      Please note that it is possible to derank from Master to Ultra
    PreviewImage: {fileID: 0}
  - Title: 'Experimental: Ranked Mode'
    Body: And with all that explained, please enjoy!
    PreviewImage: {fileID: 0}
  triggerOnlyOnce: 1
